    =&\sum_{t=1}^T \mathrm{Var}(B^\dagger_t)\\
    \leq&\sum_{t=1}^T A^\dagger_t \frac{\varepsilon}{\left(\sum_{s=1}^{t-1} A^\dagger_s +1\right)^r}
