We define $\pi_{j}(\boldsymbol{y})$ as the probability that customer $j=1,\sum_{j=1}^q$ is covered by a facility at the end of the horizon under the decision vector $\boldsymbol{y}=\{y_{it}\mid i=1,\cdots,n,\ t=1,\cdots,T\}$:
\begin{equation*}
